<h1 id="librawssg">librawssg</h1>
<p>A modular static site generator library for Rust.</p>
<p>
   This facade crate re‑exports the essential building blocks from the
   <code>librawssg</code> ecosystem, providing a single convenient entry point
   for building static site generators. It aggregates configuration management,
   filesystem abstraction, content processing, template rendering (with Tera
   built‑in), and build pipeline orchestration.
</p>
