               >new(metadata, body, url, output_path, source_path, depth,
               content_type, is_list) -&gt; Result&lt;Self&gt;</code
            >
         </li>
         <li><code>relative_url(&amp;self) -&gt; &amp;str</code></li>
         <li><code>add_taxonomy(&amp;mut self, name, items)</code></li>
         <li><code>depth(&amp;self) -&gt; usize</code></li>
         <li>
            <code
               >with_list_items(self, items: Vec&lt;Self&gt;) -&gt; Self</code
            >
         </li>
         <li>Fields: as listed earlier.</li>
      </ul>
   </li>
   <li>
      <p>
         <strong><code>Metadata</code></strong>
      </p>
      <ul>
         <li><code>new(title, description) -&gt; Result&lt;Self&gt;</code></li>
         <li><code>is_draft(&amp;self) -&gt; bool</code></li>
         <li><code>insert_extra(&amp;mut self, key, value)</code></li>
         <li>
            <code
               >get_extra(&amp;self, key: &amp;str) -&gt;
               Option&lt;&amp;serde_json::Value&gt;</code
            >
         </li>
         <li>Fields: as listed earlier.</li>
      </ul>
   </li>
   <li>
      <p>
         <strong><code>Processor</code> trait</strong>
      </p>
      <ul>
         <li>
            Required: <code>name</code>, <code>can_process</code>,
