         <li>
            <code
               >content_dir(self, dir: impl Into&lt;PathBuf&gt;) -&gt;
               Self</code
            >
         </li>
         <li>
            <code
               >output_dir(self, dir: impl Into&lt;PathBuf&gt;) -&gt; Self</code
            >
         </li>
         <li>
            <code>with_fs(self, fs: Box&lt;dyn FileSystem&gt;) -&gt; Self</code>
         </li>
         <li>
            <code
               >with_renderer(self, renderer: Box&lt;dyn Renderer&gt;) -&gt;
               Self</code
            >
         </li>
         <li>
            <code
               >add_processor(self, processor: Box&lt;dyn Processor&gt;) -&gt;
               Self</code
            >
         </li>
         <li>
            <code
               >with_context_builder(self, builder: Box&lt;dyn
               ContextBuilder&gt;) -&gt; Self</code
            >
         </li>
         <li>
            <code
               >add_generator(self, generator: Box&lt;dyn Generator&gt;) -&gt;
               Self</code
            >
         </li>
         <li><code>build(self) -&gt; Result&lt;Pipeline&gt;</code></li>
      </ul>
   </li>
   <li>
      <p>
         <strong><code>Pipeline</code></strong>
      </p>
      <ul>
         <li><code>run(&amp;self) -&gt; Result&lt;()&gt;</code></li>
         <li><code>config(&amp;self) -&gt; &amp;Config</code></li>
      </ul>
   </li>
   <li>
      <p>
         <strong><code>ContextBuilder</code> trait</strong>
      </p>
      <ul>
         <li>
            <code
               >build_context(&amp;self, config: &amp;Config, doc:
               &amp;Document) -&gt; Result&lt;Box&lt;dyn
               RenderContext&gt;&gt;</code
            >
         </li>
      </ul>
   </li>
   <li>
      <p>
         <strong><code>TeraContextBuilder</code></strong> (unit struct)
      </p>
      <ul>
         <li>Implements <code>ContextBuilder</code>.</li>
         <li>
            <code>TeraContextBuilder</code> (no fields), <code>Default</code>.
         </li>
      </ul>
   </li>
   <li>
      <p>
         <strong><code>Generator</code> trait</strong>
      </p>
      <ul>
         <li>
            <code
               >generate(&amp;self, pipeline: &amp;Pipeline, output_base:
               &amp;Path) -&gt; Result&lt;()&gt;</code
            >
         </li>
      </ul>
   </li>
   <li>
      <p>
         <strong><code>match_pattern</code> function</strong> (accessible via
         <code>librawssg::compiler::pattern::match_pattern</code>)
      </p>
      <ul>
         <li>
            Signature:
            <code
               >pub fn match_pattern(pattern: &amp;str, path: &amp;Path) -&gt;
               bool</code
            >
         </li>
         <li>
            Supports glob patterns with <code>*</code> and <code>**</code>.
         </li>
      </ul>
   </li>
</ul>
<h3 id="error-types">Error Types</h3>
<ul>
   <li>
      <p>
         <strong><code>Error</code> enum</strong> (in
         <code>librawssg::error</code>, re‑exported at root)
      </p>
      <ul>
         <li>Variants: as listed above.</li>
         <li>
            Implements <code>Display</code>, <code>Debug</code>,
            <code>std::error::Error</code>.
         </li>
         <li><code>From&lt;std::io::Error&gt;</code> is implemented.</li>
      </ul>
   </li>
   <li>
      <p>
         <strong><code>Result&lt;T&gt;</code></strong> type alias
      </p>
      <ul>
         <li>
            <code
               >pub type Result&lt;T&gt; = core::result::Result&lt;T,
               Error&gt;</code
            >
         </li>
      </ul>
   </li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h2 id="feature-flags">Feature Flags</h2>
<p>
   The <code>tera</code> feature is enabled by default and provides the
   <code>TeraRenderer</code> implementation. To disable it (e.g., if you use a
   different template engine), set <code>default-features = false</code> in your
   <code>Cargo.toml</code>:
</p>
<pre><code class="lang-toml"><span class="hljs-section">[dependencies]</span>
<span class="hljs-attr">librawssg</span> = { version = <span class="hljs-string">"1.0.0"</span>, default-features = <span class="hljs-literal">false</span> }
</code></pre>
<p>
   Without this feature, the crate still exports the core traits
   (<code>Renderer</code>, <code>RenderContext</code>) and all other
   functionality, but <code>TeraRenderer</code> and
   <code>TeraContextBuilder</code> are unavailable.
</p>
